# Build trees and fetched data. Corpora, papers, audio and page renders run to about
# 1.9 GB and every one of them is reproducible from the tools in this repository.
# None of it is carried in git.
build/
build-*/

# The rendered site. mkdocs build writes it and the GitHub Action rebuilds it on every push.
# A copy in git is one that goes stale the moment a page changes.
site/

# A deps/ folder at the root is never carried. The slash anchors it to the root, and a directory
# named deps anywhere below is carried as usual.
/deps/

# Python caches. The tools here are run directly and cache next to themselves.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# What a LaTeX run leaves beside the source when it is not given an output directory.
#
# utils/maint/texbuild/build_theory.sh compiles with -output-directory and leaves none of this. TeXworks
# and TeXShop compile IN PLACE. A research paper opened in one of those to look at it comes back with a
# .pdf, a .log, a .toc, a .aux per included chapter and a synctex index. theory/workbooks/orior picked
# up twelve such files that way, 705,688 bytes of it one synctex, and the arXiv packager copied
# every one of them into a submission before it learned to skip them.
#
# main.pdf is named instead of *.pdf on purpose. The corpus derivation chapter includes a
# matplotlib figure that is a PDF and belongs to the source.
*.aux
*.log
*.toc
*.lof
*.lot
*.out
*.synctex
*.synctex.gz
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
theory/*/*/main.pdf
theory/*/*/*/main.pdf

# What bench_raster drops where it is run from. A run writes 22 of these, and the renderer writes
# them beside the working directory instead of under build/, and the repository root collects them
# whenever a bench is run from there. Checked before adding: no tracked file matches any of the
# three. These ignore generated output and no other file.
#
# These are extensions and are deliberately unanchored, unlike `deps/`, which had to become
# `/deps/` after the bare form matched `utils/maint/deps/` at depth and hid two files that were then in
# no commit in this repository's history.
*.pgm
*.raw
*.raw.txt

# Editor and OS leavings.
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
